        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "optical",
        "summary": "Solid-state photoluminescence: upon excitation at ca. 365 nm the cluster shows reddish mixed emission from ligand-centered fluorescence (λmax = 456 nm) and EuIII f–f lines (582, 599, 621 nm). The 5D0→7F2/5D0→7F1 intensity ratio is about 2.26, consistent with low-symmetry Eu sites. Luminescence decay is biexponential (τ1 = 0.245 ms, τ2 = 0.072 ms).",
