      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "both",
        "summary": "Solid-state optical emission is a strong blue ligand/Zn–ligand-centered band with a short lifetime of 9 ns and no characteristic DyIII emission. Magnetically, χMT at 1000 Oe is 57.44 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K and rises to 83.11 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, indicating ferromagnetic Dy–Dy coupling. AC susceptibility (Hac = 3.0 Oe, 20–1600 Hz) shows slow magnetic relaxation at zero dc field (Arrhenius ΔE/kB = 56.7 K, τ0 = 4.8×10−7 s) with QTM below ~6 K. Under 2000 Oe, two processes appear (RLT: ΔE1/kB = 6.30 K, τ1 = 9.55×10−3 s; RHT: ΔE2/kB = 67.1 K, τ2 = 1.66×10−6 s). Cole–Cole α = 0.07–0.15; Mydosh parameter φ = 0.26.",
